### Key Concepts

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Trailing (default)** | Executes after the delay once calls stop |
| **Leading** | Executes immediately on the first call, then waits |
| **`cancel()`** | Clears any scheduled invocation |
| **`flush()`** | Immediately executes any pending invocation |
